From: Jay Buddhabhatti <jay.buddhabhatti@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Oct 2025 03:27:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 171/190] firmware: xilinx: Add Health Boot Monitoring error
 event masks

commit 25448e866204b11c636663912e8c60e5f45667c4 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Add HB_MON_4 through HB_MON_7 error event mask definitions for
Health Boot Monitoring errors across Versal, Versal NET, and
Versal Gen 2 platforms.

Signed-off-by: Jay Buddhabhatti <jay.buddhabhatti@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20251013102707.3821111-1-jay.buddhabhatti@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
