 .../linux/firmware/xlnx-versal-error-events.h | 22 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../firmware/xlnx-versal-net-error-events.h   | 22 ++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

